{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Only the Best Photos 是一款專為 iPhone 用家而設的相片庫清理工具，協助你以最快方式留下真正喜歡的相片與影片，其餘內容一次過移除，特別適合經常拍照、相片庫早已堆得密密麻麻的用家與內容創作者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-128.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>最愛相片以外一鍵清走</h2>\n<p>先在 Apple Photos 用心形標記想保留的相片與影片，再開啟 Only the Best Photos，依引導預覽確認清單，點按刪除其餘項目並回應 iOS 要求。最愛內容會留在相片庫，移除項目進入「最近刪除」，在 Apple 還原期限內仍可救回。相片與影片只留在裝置，不需帳號，亦無廣告或追蹤。刪除前請確認所有想保留的內容已標記為最愛。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-364-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-365-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-366-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-367-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-368-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-369-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Only the Best Photos</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/only-the-best-photos/id6499353003?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T19:00:39.186715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:46:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:54.396492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:58:33.162957+00:00","content_hash":"d5b72a41f0ef498f7a070d26ceb7acd99cbd520b8ec09db25301ba2d4c35701d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}